Q1. Write a python program to accept a string, find all words that do not contain vowels.

[10 Marks]

# Q1 Solution

string = input("Enter a string: ")

words = string.split()

# List of vowels
vowels = "aeiouAEIOU"

# Find words without vowels
result = [word for word in words if not any(char in vowels for char in word)]

print("Words without vowels:", result)


